log_irc5_0275,local_plc_scada,PLC-CELLA-ROBOT-20240921-595,2024-09-21T00:49:29Z,2024-09-21T00:52:41Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cell-a,io_update_interval_too_low,alarm,,closed,18,ERROR,comp_io_units,I/O units and PLC handshake,,,io_update_interval_ms,35.8,ms,20,ms,,OPC UA IO jitter high,PLC-side handshake showed IO update interval 35.8 ms, above 20 ms target. Robot held waiting for part-present.,Checked PLC scan and network load, no IRC5 fault.,monitoring,,,,IRC5 IO update interval too low io_update_interval_ms=35.8ms PLC OPC UA handshake action: checked plc scan and network load, no irc5 fault.,irc5_io_update_interval_too_low,
log_irc5_0276,local_plc_scada,PLC-CELLA-ROBOT-20240921-596,2024-09-21T01:32:57Z,2024-09-21T01:35:36Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cell-a,ethernet_packet_loss,alarm,,closed,18,ERROR,comp_communications,Ethernet / PROFINET link,,,ethernet_packet_loss_pct,7.4,%,2.0,%,,"PROFINET jitter to IRC5, loss 7.4%","Ethernet packet loss reached 7.4% on IRC5 controller port. TX/RX counters also climbed on switch, cell recovered after link flap.","Checked VLAN change with IT, cleared counters, monitored.",resolved,,,,"IRC5 communications ethernet packet loss ethernet_packet_loss_pct=7.4% PROFINET fieldbus TX RX action: checked vlan change with it, cleared counters, monitored.",irc5_communications_ethernet_packet_loss,,,,"{""shift"":""night"",""operator"":""M.J."",""switch_port"":""SW-A-07""}"
log_irc5_0277,SAP_PM,000102574646,2024-09-22T12:28:04Z,2024-09-22T12:33:48Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cell-a,drive_motor_overtemperature,fault,CM,closed,18,ERROR,comp_drive_module,Drive Module,39125,,drive_motor_temp_c,80.2,C,75,C,WO-IRC5-1162,Cab fan duty 83.8% and drive overtemp,"Overtemp event repeated in afternoon batch. Drive module measured 80.2C, fan duty 83.8%, cabinet door seal OK.","Cleaned filter and vacuumed intake, watched temp fall.",resolved,120,140,30,"IRC5 drive module overtemperature drive_motor_temp_c=80.2C cabinet_fan_duty_cycle_pct=83.8% action: cleaned filter and vacuumed intake, watched temp fall.",irc5_drive_motor_overtemperature,,,,"{""shift"":""day"",""operator"":""L.R."",""fan_duty_pct"":83.8}"
log_irc5_9001,manual_entry,,2026-01-15T08:30:00Z,2026-01-15T08:31:00Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,celda-a,rodamiento_ruidoso_eje3,fault,CM,open,18,ERROR,,rodamiento eje 3 (cojinete J3),,,temp_cojinete,87,degC,75,degC,,Ruido inusual en rodamiento eje 3 — temperatura elevada,El operador reportó ruido inusual (chirrido metálico) en el cojinete del eje 3 durante el ciclo de producción a alta velocidad. Temperatura del cojinete: 87°C (límite: 75°C). Velocidad reducida al 40% como medida preventiva. No se detectaron partículas metálicas en inspección visual rápida.,"Reducción de velocidad al 40%, programación de inspección detallada del cojinete.",pendiente,,,120,,irc5_bearing_noise_overtemp,fm_bearing_wear,sym_motor_vibration_overload,no_semantic,{}
log_irc5_9002,manual_entry,,2026-01-22T14:05:00Z,2026-01-22T14:06:00Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cella-a,vibrazione_anomala_j2,fault,CM,in_progress,14,WARNING,,Giunto J2 - riduttore asse 2 (ingranaggi),VIB-042,,vibration_amplitude_mm,2.3,mm,1.5,mm,,Vibrazione anomala rilevata al giunto J2 durante saldatura,L'operatore ha rilevato vibrazioni anomale al giunto J2 durante la fase di saldatura. Ampiezza oscillazione: 2.3 mm (soglia: 1.5 mm). Temperatura motore asse 2: 92°C — valore sopra la norma. Il rumore è descritto come un ronzio basso intermittente a 1200 RPM. Codice errore VIB-042 registrato dal sistema di monitoraggio vibrazioni.,Ispezione del giunto J2 avviata. Ciclo rallentato al 60%.,in corso,90,,60,,irc5_gearbox_vibration_axis2,fm_gearbox_wear,,no_semantic,{}
log_irc5_9003,manual_entry,,2026-02-03T10:15:00Z,2026-02-03T10:16:00Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,salle-machines,ventilateur_armoire_bruit,fault,CM,open,14,WARN,,ventilateur de l'armoire IRC5,,COOL-003,cabinet_internal_temp,58,degC,55,degC,,Bruit anormal du ventilateur — température armoire IRC5 élevée,Le ventilateur de refroidissement de l'armoire IRC5 émet un bruit anormal de type craquement. Température interne mesurée: 58°C (seuil d'alarme: 55°C). Filtre encrassé détecté lors d'une inspection visuelle rapide. Alarme COOL-003 active depuis 20 minutes.,Nettoyage du filtre effectué. Surveillance température en cours.,en attente de confirmation,30,20,0,,irc5_controller_cooling_fault,,,no_semantic,{}
log_irc5_9004,auto_logger,SYS-ERR-9004,2026-02-10T03:47:22Z,2026-02-10T03:47:23Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cell-a,drive_overcurrent_axis4,fault,CM,open,18,ERR,,Drive module M4 (eje 4),0x4F2,DRIVE-OC,motor_current_A,18.4,A,15.0,A,,ERR 0x4F2 — Drive module M4 overcurrent [datos corruptos parciales],ERR 0x4F2 fault on drive module M4 axis-4 -- temp_critica=97degC [DATOS CORRUPTOS: ####] eje-4 drive overcurrent 18.4A > lim 15.0A !!! INTERVENIR ### vibr=HIGH rpm=0 status=FAULT encoder_ok=? #### last_cmd=MOVE_J4 speed=80pct torque=UNKNOWN [RECORD TRUNCATED],Sistema detenido automaticamente. Tecnico llamado. Drive module aislado.,pendiente investigacion,,,240,,irc5_drive_overcurrent_axis4,fm_drive_module_failure,,"no_semantic,dirty_input","{""raw_error"": ""0x4F2"", ""truncated"": true}"
log_irc5_9005,system_logger,SYS-PANIC-9005,2026-02-18T22:11:05Z,2026-02-18T22:11:05Z,irc5-default-instance,asset_irc5,691e2a2a29b1e258a42771f9,IRC5-CTRL-01,cell-a,system_panic_dsqc1000,fault,CM,open,22,CRITICAL,,main computer DSQC 1000 (controller board),SYS-PANIC,WD-TIMEOUT,,,,,,,"System PANIC — DSQC 1000 watchdog timeout, uncontrolled stop",System panic: DSQC 1000 watchdog timeout | Traceback: task_scheduler.c:842 WD_TIMEOUT heartbeat missed 3x | task_scheduler.c:1023 TASK_DEAD main_motion_task killed | kernel.c:4420 PANIC system halt initiated | Reboot at 22:11:05 UTC | Last state: RUNNING prog_weld_cycle_a | Joints at halt: [J1=12.3 J2=-45.1 J3=89.2 J4=0.0 J5=23.7 J6=110.5] | 0xDEADBEEF at 0x00FF1234 stack overflow suspected,Sistema riavviato. Dump di memoria salvato per analisi. Tecnico allertato.,sistema riavviato causa root in analisi,,,45,,irc5_system_panic_watchdog,,,"no_semantic,multiline_joined","{""panic_type"": ""watchdog_timeout"", ""reboot"": true}"
